Exoplanet Period reads two public catalogs.

Orbital period, disposition, and the modified date come from the MAST exoplanet API at exo.mast.stsci.edu, operated by STScI.
Discovery year and discovery facility come from the NASA Exoplanet Archive TAP at exoplanetarchive.ipac.caltech.edu, operated by Caltech/IPAC.
Getting started for MAST is published at https://exo.mast.stsci.edu/docs/getting_started.html
The archive home is https://exoplanetarchive.ipac.caltech.edu/

The source code in this repository is MIT. See LICENSE.
This plugin does not ship light-curve files or the lightkurve package.
